_61":62,"_63":64,"_65":66},"type","links","field","originalImage","label","创作者原图","items",[67],{"_63":64,"_25":68},"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/9-K9/KatanaKitsune/bc9321eeaac727bbb5372a315ec58f68c96240ac/marketing/itch/05_attack.png","text","mediaReviewed","截图来源核查","value","2026-10-20","language","en","image","gameplay","Creator-published combat screenshot from the silent Godot prototype.","src","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/katana-kitsune-godot.webp","alt","The creator’s Katana Kitsune combat screenshot with an isometric courtyard, the party, enemies, health bars and minimap.","https://github.com/9-K9/KatanaKitsune/blob/bc9321eeaac727bbb5372a315ec58f68c96240ac/marketing/itch/05_attack.png","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","Creator-published screenshot","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型",[94,95],"Claude Code","GitHub Copilot","相关资源",[100,101,102,103,104],"resourceIds","section",{"_63":94,"_25":113},{"_63":111,"_25":112},{"_63":109,"_25":110},{"_63":107,"_25":108},{"_63":105,"_25":106},"Blender","/zh/resources/blender/","Meshy API","/zh/resources/meshy/","PixelLab AI Agent Toolkit","/zh/resources/pixellab/","Godot Engine · Official Documentation","/zh/resources/godot-engine/","/zh/resources/claude-code/","创作者开发记录",[117],"evidence",{"_63":118,"_25":119,"_120":121},"Read the creator’s AI production disclosure","https://9-k9.itch.io/katanakitsune","note","The author explicitly names Claude Code and GitHub Copilot alongside image, sprite and 3D asset tools, and links the primary complete source repository. The README verifies the Godot version and explains which finished assets are included.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[126],{"_63":127,"_25":128,"_120":129},"Open the complete Godot game project","https://github.com/9-K9/KatanaKitsune","Godot 4.7 project with scenes, GDScript, Dialogic addon and finished sprite assets. The inspected tree contains about 383 MB of files; no top-level game license was found. The upstream Meshy/Blender/PixelOver authoring pipeline is separate, while its finished runtime sprites are committed. The current source contains newer party/asset changes than the reviewed hosted prototype.","获取方式","playable","demo","试玩与运行",[135],{"_63":136,"_25":119,"_120":137},"Play Katana Kitsune on itch.io","Silent HTML5 prototype with keyboard and gamepad support. Space confirms player/device choices; allow a clear press and release between setup steps. The browser build loaded and reached player/device selection in review; combat and a complete dungeon run were not exercised. The download is large: about 184 MB of game data plus 40 MB of WebAssembly.","游戏平台","itch.io","指南形式","build log","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[145],{"_63":146,"_25":147,"_120":-7},"Read the game and asset-pipeline documentation","https://github.com/9-K9/KatanaKitsune#readme","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[152,153,154,155],"打开 itch 原型，选择一名真人玩家，认领键盘并选择服装。","阅读作者的 AI 披露，以及角色、战斗和精灵制作流程说明。","在 Godot 4.7 中通过 GL Compatibility 打开 project.godot；工程已包含可运行精灵和游戏场景。","调整一项战斗或生成参数，检查标题、选角、地牢、受伤和重开的完整衔接。","AI 工作流与开发背景","作者明确列出 Claude Code、GitHub Copilot、GPT Image 2、PixelLab 和 Meshy 等制作工具。仓库记录了 Meshy 绑定动画、Blender 重定向和 PixelOver 精灵导出流程；没有说明确切编程模型或各助手的代码分工。游戏里的 NPC 队友并不是 AI 辅助开发的证据。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","2D","track","metadata","资产制作工具",false,[172,173,174,105,175],"assetTools","GPT Image 2","PixelLab","Meshy","PixelOver","引擎","Godot 4.7 · GDScript · 2D / GL Compatibility","engine","lead","2d","ai-assisted",[172,173,174,105,175],{"_63":146,"_25":147,"_17":195},{"_63":136,"_25":119,"_17":131,"_120":137},{"_63":127,"_25":128,"_193":194,"_120":129},{"_63":118,"_25":119,"_120":121},[188,189,190,191,192],"claude-code","godot-engine","pixellab","meshy","blender","scope","complete-project","build-log",{"_197":198},"documents",{"_75":199,"_35":200},[202,206,207,208,205,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238,239,240,204,241,203,242,243,244,245,246,